# Subscription Packages

Subscription packages are the hard upper bound on module and permission access. Every permission check (UI and API) must validate against the active package. Defaults live in source control under `.cursor/access/` and must stay aligned with [modules.mdc](./modules.mdc) and [permissions.mdc](./permissions.mdc).

## Available packages

### Free

| module_key | Permissions |
|---|---|
| app_shell | view |
| auth_session | view, manage (self) |
| general_settings | view, update (self) |
| patient_registry | view, create |
| reports_audit | view (demo dashboards only) |

No clinical write actions, billing mutations, or dispensing.

### Basic

Includes Free, plus:

