| facility_settings | view, manage |
| access_admin | view, create, edit, assign, manage |
| subscriptions | view, manage |
| rooms_beds | view, create, edit, assign |
| patient_registry | view, create, update, export |
| opd | view, create, edit, assign |
| triage | view, create, edit |
| clinical | view, create, edit |
| ipd | view, create, edit, assign (limited beds/wards) |
